			"notes": "### RedRedRed v1.0.16rc2 Changelog:\n\nFixed the Levi-Block not scanning for the proper NBT tag type (it now searches for block NBT!) Try using the custom data command. (and it still does not work... _**so I didn't fix it yet.**_)\n\nAdded a \"(potatoish) stone chair\" because I'm bored\n\nFixed the \"potato\" blockstate in the Stone Chair block _(wait, doesn't this mean it's now **useless?**)_\n\n\nAnd a little note that I've now become better at making TPOT intro remixes, which will come in 1.0.16rc3!\n\nAdded a NOP item that shouldn't exist.\n\n**_NEW ADVANCEMENT!!!!_**"
