			"notes": "RedRedRed v1.0.16rc1 Changelog:\n\nOkay, so before I start the ACTUAL changelog, I need to tell some... _very important news._\n\nMy charger... was **STOLEN. YES. THE CHARGER I USE TO CHARGE MY LAPTOP IS GONE.**\n\nThis doesn't mean I'm doomed, I can just uuuu... that's it, I'll just changelog you guys. (this also explains why it came out on GitHub only with it being a Release Candidate)\n\n_**[changelog starts now]**_\n\nAdded a new item that you **DEFINITLY SHOUDN'T USE.** _(it will explode)_\n\nFixed an issue with the \"Graaaaaaaaaas\" block where it literally wasn't tinted, not in the creative inventory, etc. (I forgot that was a feature...)\n\nMade the Fakestone generate WAYYYY less. (I accidentally made it too high, you would see FLOODS of it before...)\n\nAdded the \"Levi-Block\" that gives levitation using NBT tags \"seconds\" and \"value\". Please note that it is horribly buggy right now, and it may take a while to fix it. (Can someone help me out here?????)\n\n**_Did you know: RedRedRed v1.0.16 was supposed to come out a day after RedRedRed v1.0.15, but due to the incident... yeah you get it._**"
		},
