			"notes": "Fixed the /givemediamonds command so it gives you the bad attributes without killing you (fixing the command not giving attributes)\n\nAdded a new \"Strong But Weak Pickaxe\" that is really OP **BUT**: it breaks _INSTANTLY_. (crafted using a regular pickaxe recipe with Cyan Stained Glass as the top material) _Did you know: a WIP version of RedRedRed v1.0.15 had the ID accidentally set to \"stong_but_weak_pickaxe\", but that was fixed._\n\nAdded both **a new painting** and a command (/explode) which allows for... _pranks?_ This will explode at your **EXACT POS**, so be careful! (maybe use stuff like \"/execute\"?) \n\nAdded **MULTIPLE** damage types and a few new advancements. \n\nAdded a new \"High Resol- wait, _I'm not supposed to talk about that..._\n\nAll armor sets have moved to a **new section.**\n\nAdded a new Stone Chair (that looks so funky lol, even the item isn't that good, at least the block model is fine.)\n\n_**[Hey there! I am REALLY sorry for the stupidly long wait, I just went on and made some private mods. I'm back! (after what felt like AGES) Sometimes humans need breaks, ya know.]**_\n\n**WARNING: the source code isnt updated whoops**"
